A language construct that deconstructs ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/algebraic-data-type.td")} values by variant, binding fields to variables and enabling the type checker to refine types in each branch - safer than raw predicates + accessors.

A language construct that **deconstructs** algebraic datatype values by variant, binding fields to variables and enabling the type checker to **refine types** in each branch - safer than raw predicates + accessors.
